## 2. Key Multi-Agent Components Implemented

### A. Extended Test Data Seeding ([`seedExtendedData.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/scripts/seedExtendedData.js))
- Seeded realistic test companies:
  - **Apex Logistics Pvt Ltd**: 2 Overdue installments totaling ₹3,37,500 (`CRITICAL` Risk Level).
