- Seeded contract agreements (`Apex_Logistics_Master_Facility_Agreement.pdf`, `CyberNet_Systems_Credit_Facility_Agreement.pdf`).

---

### B. Agent 2: Repayment Risk Assessment Agent ([`riskAgent.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/agents/riskAgent.js))
- **Logic**: Evaluates borrower repayment history, past-due installment counts, delinquency duration, and debt service ratio.
- **Output**: Calculates mathematical Risk Score (0–100), assigns Risk Level (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`, `CRITICAL`), identifies key risk factors, and recommends mitigation steps.
- **UI Component**: Slide-over [`RiskAssessmentDrawer.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/frontend/src/components/RiskAssessmentDrawer.jsx). Triggered via **`[ ⚡ Risk (Agent 2) ]`** button in Borrowing Companies directory.

---

### C. Agent 3: Automated Collection Follow-Up Agent ([`collectionAgent.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/agents/collectionAgent.js))
- **Logic**: Analyzes delinquency days and drafts tailored collection email reminders (Polite Reminder ➔ Firm Notice ➔ Urgent Demand ➔ Final Notice).
- **UI Component**: [`CollectionReminderModal.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/frontend/src/components/CollectionReminderModal.jsx). Allows 1-click generation, review, editing, and dispatch of collection notices. Triggered via **`[ 📧 Collection (Agent 3) ]`** button.

---

### D. Agent 4: Document Intelligence Agent ([`documentAgent.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/agents/documentAgent.js))
- **Logic**: Parses PDF loan contracts and extracts interest rates (12.50%), penalty interest rates (2.00% per month), facility amount (₹15,00,000.00), and governing legal clauses.
- **UI Component**: [`DocumentList.jsx`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/frontend/src/pages/DocumentList.jsx). Triggered via **`[ Extract Terms (Agent 4) ]`** button in the Document Intelligence & Contract Vault.

